abstract: "Paused research archive covering color constancy, instrument-referenced skin color, analytical and neural learning, palette transfer preparation, architecture scaling and facial-skin segmentation. Includes complete source references, test definitions, negative results and incomplete-run receipts. Ordinary-selfie instrument color accuracy remains unvalidated."
